OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fpersisting at first through the
OL,7,Fevening before gradually easing
OL,8,Fovernight as cloud breaks up, leaving
OL,9,Fclear spells for many. Winds also die
OL,10,Fdown into the early hours. Feeling
OL,11,Fcool overnight for many.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FDry with plenty of sunny
OL,14,Fspells across the region. Some patchy
OL,15,Fcloud in places. Winds a lot lighter
OL,16,Fthan Tuesday making it feel slightly
OL,17,Fwarmer.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
