OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FStaying changeable through the week,
OL,7,Fas another band of rain moves eastward
OL,8,Fon Thursday, before drier and brighter
OL,9,Fweather returns on Friday. With
OL,10,Funsettled conditions once again
OL,11,FSaturday.
